1
00:00:18,032 --> 00:00:25,610
My footsteps echo on the floor,
I open up the heavy door.

2
00:00:25,841 --> 00:00:32,601
The empty pews stand row by row,
Like gravestones that watch me go.

3
00:00:34,599 --> 00:00:42,065
Where are you, Luna, hear my cry?!
I tear your name into the sky!

4
00:00:42,847 --> 00:00:49,003
My Lion weeps inside my chest,
No answer comes to bring me rest!

5
00:00:53,204 --> 00:01:00,751
I walk in silence to the cross,
And look up at the organ loft.

6
00:01:01,279 --> 00:01:07,755
Where I once played and hid my love,
And where my spirit broke in two!

7
00:01:09,797 --> 00:01:17,183
Where are you, Luna, hear my cry?!
I tear your name into the sky!

8
00:01:18,014 --> 00:01:24,556
My Lion weeps inside my chest,
No answer comes to bring me rest!

9
00:01:28,406 --> 00:01:36,294
The heavy door falls shut and tight,
A silence that won't end tonight.

10
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:44,701
The downpour strikes me on the street,
My engine hums its low, deep beat.

11
00:01:47,035 --> 00:01:54,364
Where are you, Luna, hear my cry?!
I tear your name into the sky!

12
00:01:55,318 --> 00:02:01,776
My Lion weeps inside my chest,
No answer comes to bring me rest!

13
00:02:38,766 --> 00:02:46,060
Wet asphalt hisses underneath,
I push the throttle fast and deep.

14
00:02:46,517 --> 00:02:53,442
And then your house comes into sight,
Behind the curtain burns a light!

15
00:02:55,288 --> 00:03:03,213
My voice tears through the rain and street,
Just like a dying beast's defeat!

16
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:11,621
I tear the words from deep inside:
I love you, Luna! in the night!

